## Third-Party Open Source Components
LibreOpus uses only open-source libraries with no proprietary blobs or
analytics SDKs:

- Kotlin Standard Library & kotlinx.coroutines (Apache-2.0)
- AndroidX Core, Activity, Lifecycle, Navigation, DataStore, DocumentFile (Apache-2.0)
- Jetpack Compose UI & Material 3 (Apache-2.0)
- JUnit 4 (EPL-1.0, test-only)
